            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani AABBO Waaqi waan jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani ya lafa gaareeni tana keesati turtani, tanaafi amma mirga godaanu maltani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.36.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 36.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba gaafasi dubbi tana worrati himi naani jed'e: Isani amma ya lafa gaareeni Edomu ta fago ta fiit'aani teesani ilmaani Esau keesa teetuti godaanu geetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri isani sodaata, ammo isani worrani woli had'u himmalle, wonti akanatiifi anini lafa worra fulla tokole isani inkennu. Anini lafa Edomu yayu d'aloota Esauti kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagale nyaatanifi bisaani d'uddanile iraa bitad'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaabad'a aka AABBO Waaqi keesani waan isani tolchitani ch'ufa keesa isani eebise. Inni yayu godaana isani lafa aloo ballo tana keesa godaantanile isani qorqorate. Inni ya ganna afurtama kana isani woliini tae, isanileeni ya waan feetani ch'ufa argatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani nu oboleyaani teenna ilmaani Esau, ta lafa Seiru teetu, biraa godaanne kara Araba ka Elathifi Esion-Geberi bahu gula qajeele, duuba eege lafa aloo ta Moabuti gorre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 19.37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle AABBO Waaqi waan naani jed'e, worra Moabu ka d'aloota Lutu ingaargalchina yokhaani woli inhad'ina, wonti akanatiifi anini dira Ari yayu d'aala worraati kenne lafa worraa fulla tokole isanii inkennu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Emi suni ka duri achi tau worra jajaba, gugurda d'ed'eera aka worra gosa Anaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma worra Anaki suni worraleeni Refemu jed'ani; ammo worri Moabu worrani Emi jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Hori duri lafa Edomu keesa taa ammo eege d'alooti Esau worra achi achi keesaa gusse balleese, ufi achi qubate, akuma worri Israeli nyaapa worra lafa AABBO Waaqi kenneefi keesaa gusse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akuma AABBO Waaqi nuuni jed'e, nu kaane galaana Zeredi taakine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 14.28-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafi kunini ganna sodomi saddeeteesoti, haga nu Kadesh-Barnea baane, akuma AABBO Waaqi jed'e kaani, nami duula d'aqu dandau ka d'aloota suni ch'ufti hobae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi nyaapa worraati tahe worra ch'ufa hobaase",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
